  - m_Id: 1118822400
    m_Localized: "ENVIRONMENT OFFICER \xB7 FIELD NOTES"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016704
    m_Localized: Qingxi Field Notes
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016705
    m_Localized: Three action points. Observe first, then decide where to dig deeper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016706
    m_Localized: Choose a case
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016707
    m_Localized: Solve each case to unlock the next. Progress saves automatically.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016708
    m_Localized: YOUR ASSIGNMENT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016709
    m_Localized: 'Move with WASD / arrow keys. Press E near a location.

      Observations
      are free; each in-depth check costs 1 action point.

      N opens your notes.
      Esc goes back. Progress saves automatically.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
