    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016763
    m_Localized: Invalid investigation area
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016764
    m_Localized: You have already observed this location
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016765
    m_Localized: You have already investigated this location
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016766
    m_Localized: Not enough action points
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016767
    m_Localized: Murky River
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016768
    m_Localized: Qingxi Town
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016769
    m_Localized: "Qingxi Town \xB7 The river flows south"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016770
    m_Localized: The river in Qingxi Town is becoming polluted. As the environmental
      officer, use your 3 action points to identify the main source.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016771
    m_Localized: You identified the main pollution source. Cleanup is progressing
      well, and Qingxi's river is gradually running clear again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016772
    m_Localized: The main source was misidentified, so cleanup has had little effect.
      Take a closer look at evidence of wastewater discharges upstream.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016773
    m_Localized: Tests show mostly organic wastewater, with very little plastic.
      Fish deaths trace back to toxins from upstream. The livestock farm has records
      of illegal night discharges, and its treatment system has been idle for months.
      The recycling yard's liner is intact, while residents trace the nighttime odor
      to the farm. The main source is illegal wastewater discharge from the livestock
      farm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016774
    m_Localized: River sampling site
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016775
    m_Localized: River
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016776
    m_Localized: The river is murky, with plastic fragments and unidentified oily
      patches on the surface.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016777
    m_Localized: Water tests show that organic wastewater makes up most of the pollution;
      plastic accounts for very little.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016778
    m_Localized: Livestock farm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016779
    m_Localized: Livestock Farm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016780
    m_Localized: The livestock farm is large, and its discharge outlet leads directly
      to the river downstream.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016781
    m_Localized: Records reveal illegal wastewater discharges at night. The treatment
      system has been out of operation for months.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016782
    m_Localized: Fish pond
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016783
    m_Localized: Fish Pond
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016784
    m_Localized: Some fish have died, and the pond appears overcrowded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016785
    m_Localized: Tests on the fish show signs of poisoning. The toxins came from
      upstream water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016786
    m_Localized: Recycling yard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016787
    m_Localized: Recycling Yard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016788
    m_Localized: Piles of discarded plastic sit beside the river, suggesting a risk
      of leakage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016789
    m_Localized: The protective liner is intact. There is no sign of a significant
      recent plastic leak.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016790
    m_Localized: Residential Area
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016791
    m_Localized: Residents complain that the river has smelled strongly in recent
      days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016792
    m_Localized: Several residents confirm that the strongest odor comes from the
      livestock farm late at night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016793
    m_Localized: Illegal discharge from the livestock farm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016794
    m_Localized: Plastic leakage from the recycling yard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016795
    m_Localized: Overcrowding in the fish pond
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016796
    m_Localized: Reservoir Algal Bloom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016797
    m_Localized: Qingxi Reservoir
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016798
    m_Localized: "Qingxi Reservoir \xB7 A tributary enters from the west"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016799
    m_Localized: Qingxi Reservoir supplies the town's drinking water, but its surface
      has recently turned green. As the environmental officer, use your 3 action
      points to identify the main cause of the algal bloom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016800
    m_Localized: You identified the main pollution source. The overflow has been
      stopped, and the reservoir's algal bloom is beginning to recede.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016801
    m_Localized: The main source was misidentified, and the bloom is still spreading.
      Investigate the heavily polluted water entering from the western tributary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016802
    m_Localized: Tests identify a cyanobacterial bloom fueled by nitrogen and phosphorus,
      with very little oil. Fish-cage feeding is low this year, and the restaurant
      drains into the municipal sewer. Residents first noticed the odor when the
      western tributary rose. Rain caused the fertilizer plant's emergency holding
      pond to overflow into that tributary. The main source is the fertilizer plant's
      overflow after rain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016803
    m_Localized: Reservoir surface
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016804
    m_Localized: Reservoir
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016805
    m_Localized: Large green films float on the water, with a few oily streaks mixed
      in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016806
    m_Localized: Tests identify a cyanobacterial bloom. The main nutrients are nitrogen
      and phosphorus; oil levels are extremely low.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016807
    m_Localized: Cage fish farm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016808
    m_Localized: Fish Cages
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016809
    m_Localized: Rows of fish cages occupy the bay, and feed bags are piled along
      the shore.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016810
    m_Localized: Feeding is far below previous years. The cages contribute little
      nitrogen or phosphorus and are not the main cause of this bloom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016811
    m_Localized: Fertilizer Plant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016812
    m_Localized: The fertilizer plant beside the western tributary gives off a sharp
      odor. Wet streaks mark the ground outside its wall.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016813
    m_Localized: After the rain, the emergency holding pond overflowed, sending wastewater
      rich in nitrogen and phosphorus into the western tributary.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016814
    m_Localized: Lakeside restaurant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016815
    m_Localized: Restaurant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016816
    m_Localized: The restaurant's drainage pipe points toward the bay, and there
      is a strong smell of dishwater.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016817
    m_Localized: The drain is connected to the municipal sewer. Spot checks this
      past week found no signs of kitchen wastewater in the bay.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016818
    m_Localized: Water intake neighborhood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016819
    m_Localized: Water Intake
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016820
    m_Localized: Residents say their tap water is greenish and still smells earthy
      after boiling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016821
    m_Localized: Several households say the odor began when the western tributary
      rose, matching the inflow from the fertilizer plant's direction.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016822
    m_Localized: Fish-cage farming in the bay
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016823
    m_Localized: Overflow from the fertilizer plant after rain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016824
    m_Localized: Direct discharge from the lakeside restaurant
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016825
    m_Localized: Rust-Red Mountain Creek
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016826
    m_Localized: Qingxi Mountain Creek
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016827
    m_Localized: "Qingxi Mountain Creek \xB7 Check the eastern hillside inflow"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016828
    m_Localized: Qingxi's upper mountain creek has suddenly turned rusty yellow,
      making the downstream irrigation water unusable. As the environmental officer,
      use your 3 action points to identify the main cause.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016829
    m_Localized: You identified the main pollution source. The acidic drainage has
      been contained, and the creek and irrigation channels are gradually clearing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016830
    m_Localized: The main source was misidentified, and rusty water is still flowing
      downstream. Investigate the rust-colored inflow from the eastern hillside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016831
    m_Localized: Tests show excessive iron, manganese and acidity, pointing to acid
      mine drainage rather than foam. The guesthouse discharges little water, and
      the quarry's settling pond releases clear water. Farmers saw rusty water rush
      down from the eastern mine. Its sealing wall collapsed after rain, releasing
      trapped water into the creek. The main source is acidic drainage from the abandoned
      mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016832
    m_Localized: Mountain creek channel
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016833
    m_Localized: Mountain Creek
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016834
    m_Localized: The creek is rusty yellow, the rocks are stained red, and white
      foam floats on the surface.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016835
    m_Localized: Iron, manganese and acidity are far above safe levels, indicating
      acid mine drainage. Foam cannot explain the entire creek's rusty color.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016836
    m_Localized: Creekside guesthouse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016837
    m_Localized: Guesthouse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016838
    m_Localized: A newly opened guesthouse discharges foamy wash water into the creek.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016839
    m_Localized: The discharge is small and mainly contains surfactants. It cannot
      explain the creek's acidity, iron or manganese levels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016840
    m_Localized: Stone Quarry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016841
    m_Localized: The hillside quarry produces heavy dust, and a muddy ditch leads
      straight to the creek.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016842
    m_Localized: The muddy water is diverted into a settling pond, whose outflow
      is clear. It is not the main source of the rusty water.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016843
    m_Localized: Abandoned mine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016844
    m_Localized: Mine Entrance
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016845
    m_Localized: A mine on the eastern hillside has been sealed for years. The rock
      below its entrance is stained rusty red.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016846
    m_Localized: The sealing wall collapsed after the rain, releasing water trapped
      in the mine into the creek.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016847
    m_Localized: Irrigation district farms
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016848
    m_Localized: Irrigation Fields
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016849
    m_Localized: Farmers say their rice seedlings turned yellow after irrigation.
      They suspect someone dumped something into the channel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016850
    m_Localized: Several households saw rusty water rush down from the eastern mine.
      The irrigation channel changed color that same day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016851
    m_Localized: Detergent from the creekside guesthouse
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016852
    m_Localized: Direct slurry discharge from the quarry
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1123016853
    m_Localized: Acidic drainage from the abandoned mine
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 629949849600
    m_Localized: Pollution from fish farming
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27680832479232
    m_Localized: FIELD TREATMENT
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27680912171008
    m_Localized: Contain the discharge
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27680912171009
    m_Localized: Divert the overflow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27680912171010
    m_Localized: Repair the mine barrier
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27680912171011
    m_Localized: Drag the three barriers into the marked positions in the drainage
      channel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27680912171012
    m_Localized: Drag in four pipe sections. Click to rotate and connect the outlet
      to the holding tank.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27680912171013
    m_Localized: Match three repair panels to the gaps, then install both support
      beams.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27680912171014
    m_Localized: Barriers {0} / 3
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 27680912171015
    m_Localized: "Pipes {0} / 4 \xB7 Aligned {1} / 4"
